woowtechbot for Podman
Copyright 2026 WOOWTECH

This repository contains packaging (Podman Quadlet units, install and
maintenance scripts, documentation) for woowtechbot, the WOOWTECH build of
the OpenMausBot open-source project (https://github.com/milind-soni/OpenMausBot),
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The separately
licensed enterprise/ tree of OpenMausBot is not used.

The container images referenced by this packaging carry their own LICENSE and
NOTICE files, including the upstream OpenMausBot attributions. This project is
not endorsed by the OpenMausBot authors.

The local image built by scripts/install.sh also contains Hermes Agent
(https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent), Copyright (c) 2025 Nous
Research, MIT License, copied from the official image; its LICENSE is
/opt/hermes/LICENSE in the image. This project is not endorsed by Nous Research.
